ontent or masks can still hide it; visually inspect the preview.","Invisible text mode 3 and zero-opacity text may be OCR/search overlays. Their fonts, sizes and colors are metadata, not proof of visible editable typography.","Text outlines appear as vector paths; raster lettering appears in images. These cannot be identified as a font solely by this report.","Hex values quantize PDF-extracted RGB to 8-bit. Transparency, blending, color profiles and backgrounds can change the rendered appearance.","A raw fill color with opacity below 1 is not an observed opaque swatch. Retain opacity and background, or sample the actual rendered region. Overlapping/translucent objects cannot be reduced to one reliable color by a general white-background formula.","Implausible raw stroke widths can result from unreconciled PDF transforms. Flagged widths are not measurements in points and are excluded from stroke summaries; they never expand the crop-selection bounds.","Vector selection uses intersecting path bounds (expanded by half stroke width), not full clipping/occlusion evaluation. Paths crossing the crop retain full-object bounds.","Clip/group metadata is recorded when supported, but composite visibility is not reconstructed. Counts can include clipped or obscured paths.","Path counts include outlined glyphs and are not palette area or importance. Character counts may double-count fill-plus-stroke rendering.","Text is in PDF paint order; inferred spaces and reading order are not added. A trace may contain only one character.","Measured point sizes describe source-paper placement, not a recommended production size or a corporate house style.","Source objects and figures must be visually inspected before drawing aesthetic conclusions. No quality score is inferred."],"evidence_class":"measured","provenance":{"paper_id":"hunyuanworld2","table_id":"hunyuanworld2--table-7","anchor":"Table 7","source_url":"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2604.14268v1","version":"2604.14268v1","pdf_sha256":"6a92